OL,3,ASchool 'deeply saddened' by death of
OL,4,Afamily in sea off Shoreham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school attended by a 14-year-old girl
OL,7,Fwho died alongside her father and
OL,8,Fmother after getting into difficulty in
OL,9,Fwater off the coast of Shoreham-by-Sea
OL,10,Fhas paid tribute to her.
OL,12,FSara El-Khawas and her parents Hassan
OL,13,FEl-Khawas, 55, and Zeina Alayn, 37, are
OL,14,Fbelieved to have gone into the water
OL,15,Fnear Shoreham Fort in West Sussex on
OL,16,FTuesday, according to Sussex Police.
OL,18,FIn a statement on its website, the
OL,19,FEllen Wilkinson School for Girls in
OL,20,FEaling, west London, described Sara as
OL,21,Fa "sweet girl, well-liked by staff and
OL,22,Fstudents".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
